        "Background": "Dr. Heiji Tomori, a groundbreaking artificial-intelligence researcher, was recruited as the lone man at the Malicron Corporation, where his work made the company's long-held dream, Project MIHO, real. Soon afterward he was killed in an accident — or so everyone believes. Drawing on his expertise with artificial brains, he had copied his entire mind into Malicron's network. Unknown to anyone, he quietly steers the company's work and searches the world's networks for any sign of his beloved Miho."
